WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The word BLUE appears in red ink. Which answer came first?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1935, Stroop found conflicting words slowed ink naming far more than colored ink slowed word reading.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The mismatch is real. It does not mean your mind is defective.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Mindfulness studies test particular practices and comparisons, not every commercial recording.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes of attention practice for free, with the Focus Fieldbook.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then inspect the exact audio package and evidence before considering any purchase.
